{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"3330e181-fde6-448a-b352-c45e4ab89813","agentId":"aeeeb795d3144714a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Design a new logo mark + favicon for a product just renamed \"Lighthouse\" (hackathon project; repo /Users/jonasstenglein/OtherProjects/StartMunichHack/ask-soony). Do NOT edit any file in the repo; work only in /Users/jonasstenglein/.claude/jobs/3021cc1a/tmp/logo/ (create it).\n\nContext: Lighthouse is an AI procurement product: agents watch a supply chain, notice problems early (before the ship hits the rock), show the evidence and ask the right person to decide. Calm, typographic UI: ink #18181a on off-white #fbfbfa, accent blue #2348d0 (actions only), green #16795d only for \"an agent did this\", red #c8321f only for \"misses the trucks\". Font Instrument Sans.\n\nCurrent mark (read it): web/public/favicon.svg and the `Mark` component in web/src/components/TopBar.tsx (four viewfinder corner brackets around a filled rounded bar, 24x24 viewBox, stroke 2.4, square caps). The favicon is theme-aware (prefers-color-scheme inside the SVG); keep that technique.\n\nDeliver 4 variants, each as a standalone 24x24 viewBox SVG that reads at 16px: \n1. Current corners kept, inner bar replaced by a light beam (a narrow wedge widening to one side, like a lighthouse sweep).\n2. Same as 1 plus a small solid light point where the beam starts.\n3. A minimal abstract lighthouse: tower as a tapered shape with a lit window/lantern, no clip-art details, geometric, same stroke weight family.\n4. Your own best idea that ties \"seeing early / signal\" to the name, still minimal.\nRules: one colour (currentColor) for the mark, optional accent only if it stays legible in both themes; no gradients, no text; crisp at 16px (align to pixel grid, avoid hairlines < 2px at 24 units).\n\nThen render a single preview PNG (/Users/jonasstenglein/.claude/jobs/3021cc1a/tmp/logo/preview.png): each variant at 16, 32 and 64 px, on light (#fbfbfa) and dark (#18181a) backgrounds, plus next to the word \"Lighthouse\" at top-bar size (20px mark + 15px medium text), labelled 1-4. Render with headless Chrome: \"/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome\" --headless=new --screenshot=... --window-size=... file://...html. Look at the PNG yourself (Read tool) and iterate until each variant is clean at 16px.\n\nReturn: the 4 SVG paths, the preview path, one line per variant on what it is, and which one you recommend and why (2 sentences). Do not use em dashes."},"uuid":"6fd67698-8092-4c48-bff3-26ded7e838c3","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:49:15.136Z","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jonasstenglein/OtherProjects/StartMunichHack/ask-soony","sessionId":"3021cc1a-f777-4712-b18b-d31b6ece5ff1","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"main","slug":"hashed-watching-parnas-of-3021cc1a-f777-4712-b18b-d31b6ece5ff1","dataFlowOn":true}
